 y in a relaxed\, natural setting\, promoting well-being and community spir
 it. You can receive a $6 coupon for Ramekin (limited to one each).\nMeet i
 n front of the Guarini School\, Anonymous Hall – across from Ramekin Caf
 e.\nGuariniGRAD Dialogues\nare a series of events designed to bring gradua
 te students\, postdocs\, and faculty together in informal settings to fost
 er empathy\, understanding\, and a deeper sense of community. By creating 
 spaces where differing views\, perspectives\, and circumstances can be sha
 red and appreciated\, these dialogues aim to strengthen connections within
  the Dartmouth community and foster a sense of belonging.\n*Guarini gradua
