DESCRIPTION:Original event page(s):\nhttps://home.dartmouth.edu/events/eve
 nt?event=82939\nhttps://givebutter.com/hanover-klezmer-concert-for-ukraine
 s-children-of-war?s=fryrJg\n\nDescription:\nMusic for Good: Kommuna Lux Li
 ve from Hanover- FREE CONCERT\nJoin us for this unique multicultural event
  beginning at 4:00 PM on Friday\, October 9\, 2026 at Christ Church at Dar
 tmouth College- 40 College Street\, Hanover\, NH.\nWe are excited to join 
 internationally acclaimed Ukrainian ensemble\nKommuna Lux\nfor an unforget
 table evening of music while helping children whose lives have been devast
 ated by war. Light food will be available following this free concert. Our
  co-hosts for the evening are Hanover Rotary Club\, the Lebanon Rotary Clu
 b\, and Dartmouth Ukrainian Student Alliance.\nAll proceeds benefit the\nC
 ommon Man for Ukraine\n\, a humanitarian\, volunteer-led grassroots initia
 tive of the Plymouth\, NH Rotary Foundation. Your tax-deductible contribut
 ion provide food\, generators\, emergency relief\, and trauma counseling f
 or orphaned children and their widowed mothers. This is an immediate and i
 mpactful way to help alleviate their suffering. If you cannot attend\, ple
 ase consider making a donation. Non-anonymous donors will be recognized in
  the printed concert program.\nFREE event -\ndonations and sponsorships we
 lcome\n100% of proceeds going to trauma retreats for the children and wido
 ws of Ukraine's lost soldiers as well as humanitarian aid to frontline com
 munities.\nThere will be a short presentation about Common Man for Ukraine
  programs (approx. 15 min.)\nFeel free to come up and talk to us after the
  concert to learn more!\n4:00 PM - 7 PM (Doors open at 3:30 PM).\nThanks t
 o our generous sponsors!\nDartmouth Student Alliance for Ukraine\nLebanon 
 Rotary\nHanover Rotary\nPlymouth Rotary\nDartmouth College\nCome for extra
 ordinary music. Leave knowing you helped bring hope\, healing\, and practi
 cal aid to Ukraine's children and families.\nHere's the link for more info
