 The\nDartmouth-Tuck Real Estate Conference\nbrings together alumni\, stude
 nts\, faculty\, and industry leaders for candid conversations about the fo
 rces shaping real estate today and the opportunities ahead.\nHosted by the
  Tuck Real Estate Club in collaboration with Real Estate Alumni of Dartmou
 th (\nReal D\n)\, students\, and faculty\, the annual conference explores 
 the real estate landscape from a range of perspectives\, from investing an
 d capital markets to development\, financing\, and evolving opportunities 
 across property sectors. Through keynote conversations and practitioner-le
 d panels\, attendees hear directly from industry leaders navigating today
 ’s market\, deploying capital\, developing projects\, and identifying va
 lue amid changing economic and market conditions.\nThe 2026 conference wil
 l take place at Tuck in Hanover\, NH\, beginning with a\nwelcome reception
  and keynote address on Thursday\, October 22\n\, followed by a full day o
 f programming on\nFriday\, October 23\n. Friday will feature panel discuss
 ions\, networking opportunities\, and a special Real Estate Conference edi
 tion of Tuck ’Tails (cocktail reception).\nMore than an industry confere
 nce\, the event is an opportunity to strengthen the growing Dartmouth and 
 Tuck real estate community\, bringing together perspectives from across th
 e real estate ecosystem for thoughtful discussion\, shared learning\, and 
 meaningful connections.\n\nSponsor / organizer: Center for Private Equity 
 and Venture Capital\n\nAudience: Public\n\nSource: Dartmouth\n\nWhy this w
 as included: food keyword near service context\n\nFood availability is inf
 erred from the source listing\; verify details before attending.
