DESCRIPTION:Original event page(s):\nhttps://dartmouthgroups.dartmouth.edu
 /rsvp_boot?id=1631687\n\nDescription:\nThe National Society of Black Women
  in Medicine (NSBWM) at Dartmouth College will host its Fall Induction Cer
 emony to formally welcome and celebrate new members joining the organizati
 on. The ceremony will introduce members to NSBWM’s mission\, values\, an
 d commitment to supporting Black women pursuing careers in medicine and he
 althcare while highlighting the importance of mentorship\, professional de
 velopment\, academic excellence\, and community. The event will include re
 marks from the executive board and a featured healthcare professional or s
 tudent\, followed by a formal induction recognizing new members. The cerem
 ony will conclude with a reception where new and returning members can con
 nect\, build relationships\, and learn about opportunities to become invol
 ved throughout the academic year. The event will create a strong sense of 
 belonging and establish a supportive foundation for NSBWM’s programming 
 and community for the year ahead.\nFood Provided\n\nSponsor / organizer: N
 ational Society of Black Women in Medicine\n\nSource: Dartmouth Groups\n\n
